name sasnrdisplay
category Package
revision 63255
shortdesc Typeset SAS or R code or output
longdesc The SASnRdisplay package serves as a front-end to listings,
longdesc which permits statisticians and others to import source code
longdesc and the results of their calculations or simulations into LaTeX
longdesc projects. The package is also capable of overloading the Sweave
longdesc User Manual and SASweave packages.
